OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWinds easing
OL,6,Fand staying largely dry but cloudy
OL,7,Fthis evening, although a few spots of
OL,8,Flight rain are possible, particularly
OL,9,Ffurther north. Further outbreaks of
OL,10,Flight rain are possible overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cloudy start to the day with
OL,13,Fbrisk winds, and a risk of showers.
OL,14,FShowers becoming more isolated into
OL,15,Fthe afternoon, with a chance of some
OL,16,Fbrighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
